      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Laurel_Park%2C_North_Carolina",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Laurel Park was formally incorporated in 1925, solidifying its status as an official municipality.",
